                                "sense_id": "989f1e5f-7c2e-3be9-81c5-4b33cea6c4d8",
                                "text": "Brachygraphie, Poſt-Writt. OR, THE ART OF Short-writing. Where moſt Letters conſiſt of ſingle ſtroakes or motions of the Pen, in beſt formes of Penſhip."
